#!/usr/bin/python3
"""GlobalProtect tray indicator for GlobalProtect-openconnect (gpclient/gpauth).

Authentication (gpauth + browser) runs as the desktop user; only the tunnel
itself (gpclient connect --cookie-on-stdin) is run as root, through pkexec and
a small helper, so the browser never runs as root and no `sudo -E` is needed.
"""

